// ThRei scoreboard clan tag format.
// Placeholders: {cn}, {rank}, {mode}, {mode_short}, {mode_initial}
//
// {mode_initial}: V = Vanilla, S = SimpleKZ, K = KZTimer
// {mode_short}:   VNL / SKZ / KZT (used by the chat tag)
//
// CS:GO shows at most 15 clan-tag characters. If the formatted tag is
// longer, the plugin drops the outer brackets automatically.
//
// Default:
//   [{mode_initial} CN {rank}] -> [K CN Amateur+] / K CN Beginner+
//
// Other examples:
//   {mode_initial} CN {rank}   -> K CN Beginner+ (always fits)
//   [{mode_short} CN {rank}]   -> [KZT CN Beginner+] (will truncate)
sm_threi_clan_format "[{mode_initial} CN {rank}]"
